      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL Shortener API with PostgreSQL-backed links and click counts, all required routes and response codes, and an executable `start.sh` that runs migrations before serving on `0.0.0.0:8000`. The README explains how to start it.\n\nVerified the API over HTTP: creation (custom and generated codes), duplicate-code conflict, invalid and missing URLs, malformed JSON, lookup, listing, unknown codes, and redirect/click tracking. Ruby syntax checks and `sh -n start.sh` pass. `rails test` passes, but the generated project has no automated tests yet. I also pinned JSON to a version compatible with the Rails JSON encoder used by this environment.",
